  "scope": [
    "Isolated source archive and build; production decoder code unchanged.",
    "Normal application calls only; no entitlement, sandbox policy or OS protection changes.",
    "CreateWithOptions ABI and exported keys validated against installed VideoToolbox image; this is not a supported public API or a shipping recommendation.",
    "Requests and readbacks are reported separately. API success alone does not establish an in-process decoder.",
    "Correctness checks include exact software-reference pixels, dimensions, hardware, IOSurface/Metal compatibility, visible frame identity and ownership after decoder destruction.",
    "These correctness runs contain an intentional two-second process-observation pause; none of their timing metrics is a latency benchmark."
  ],
